@VanLife.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7250

@SellerId = 2cb91a52-42b5-4f59-9f3a-a96925f90488

@BuyerId = 73a10d33-7da4-4f0a-b58d-0d0efc5e70e3

@UserId = {{SellerId}}

@VanId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

@ImageId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000



### Vans - list
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans?page=1&pageSize=5&skip=0&category=Luxury&minPrice=50&maxPrice=300
Accept: application/json


### Vans - search
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans?query=luxury+solar&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json


### Van details
## Paste the van GUID below (replace the zeros) to run this request:
@VanId = fa070bb9-47e9-4d40-b0dd-e2d387238899
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans/{{VanId}}
Accept: application/json


### Seller - management details
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans/{{VanId}}/management?sellerId={{SellerId}}
Accept: application/json


### Seller - list inventory
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans/seller/vans?sellerId={{SellerId}}&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json


### Seller - create a new van
POST {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans/seller/vans?sellerId={{SellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Cozy Camper",
  "category": "Simple",
  "pricePerDay": 95,
  "fullDescription": "Small camper with kitchen and bed.",
  "numberAvailable": 2
}


### Seller - update a van
PUT {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans/seller/vans/{{VanId}}?sellerId={{SellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "pricePerDay": 99,
  "numberAvailable": 3
}


### Seller - update availability
PATCH {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans/seller/vans/{{VanId}}/availability?sellerId={{SellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": true,
  "numberAvailable": 3
}


### Auth - sign up
POST {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Daisy",
  "lastName": "Sophia",
  "username": "daisy",
  "idNumber": "NIN1234567890",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "phone": "555-0100",
  "nextOfKin": "Jane Sophia",
  "email": "daisy@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!",
  "role": "Buyer"
}


### Auth - login
POST {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@vanlife.com",
  "password": "Buyer123!",
  "role": "Buyer"
}


### Rent van (buyerId required)
POST {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vans/{{VanId}}/rent?buyerId={{BuyerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "days": 3,
  "destination": "Abuja",
  "contact": "555-0100",
  "paymentToken": "fake-payment-token",
  "cautionFee": 50
}


### Dashboard - seller summary
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/sellers/{{SellerId}}?page=1&pageSize=5&skip=0&days=30
Accept: application/json


### Dashboard - income graph
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/income-graph?year=2026&sellerId={{SellerId}}
Accept: application/json


### Dashboard - transactions
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/transactions?sellerId={{SellerId}}&page=1&pageSize=5&skip=0&days=14&minPrice=100
Accept: application/json


### Reviews
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reviews?userId={{UserId}}&page=1&pageSize=5&skip=0&startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31&reviewType=Positive
Accept: application/json


### Images - upload
POST {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/images/upload?fileName=van-photo.jpg&vanId={{VanId}}&sellerId={{SellerId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Accept: application/json

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="van-photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-resources/van-photo.jpg
--boundary--


### Images - list
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/images?page=1&pageSize=10&skip=0
Accept: application/json


### Images - delete
DELETE {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/api/images/{{ImageId}}?sellerId={{SellerId}}
Accept: application/json


### 404 test
GET {{VanLife.Api_HostAddress}}/this-does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
